SUMMARY:Miles Electric Band
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Led by Vince Wilburn Jr. — Miles Davis's nephew and a member of Davis's 1980s bands — the Miles Electric Band keeps the electric\, funk-driven fusion era of Miles Davis (the Bitches Brew/On the Corner years) alive on stage.
